{"title":"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> people on a bus. At the first stop <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> people get off the bus. At the second stop <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> people get on the bus. How many people are on the bus after the second stop?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After the first stop, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> people get off the bus, so there are now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> fewer people on the bus than there were before. Thus, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6dfa0505ddccfe49393944d1cd2eed3dc951258.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> people on the bus.\n</p><p>After the second stop, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> people get on the bus, so there are now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more people on the bus than there were before. Thus, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/1/6b16391918f0b4bfb60420a153764283eaa611b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N - 2 + 9 = N + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"16\" /> people on the bus.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3\">player 3</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/45456dc72bca26c9aa471784fa4974ac8be42201.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/787e3e5f6d264144932047deebad78a531970bd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N + 7 = 17 + 7 = \\boxed{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"177\" height=\"25\" /> people on the bus.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\